## Derived Work - superpowers Plugin

Portions of this software are derived from the superpowers plugin by Jesse Vincent.

The following components incorporate methodologies and patterns from superpowers:

### Agent Methodologies
- **agents/orchestrate-debugger.md** - 4-phase debugging methodology (Root Cause Investigation → Pattern Analysis → Hypothesis Testing → Implementation), "NO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE" principle, 3-attempt escalation rule
- **agents/orchestrate-spec-reviewer.md** - "DISTRUST THE IMPLEMENTER'S REPORT" principle, independent code verification approach, skeptical review mindset
- **agents/orchestrate-quality-reviewer.md** - Two-stage review gate structure, severity classification (CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), review report format
- **agents/orchestrate-builder.md** - TDD enforcement with "NO PRODUCTION CODE WITHOUT A FAILING TEST FIRST" (the "Iron Law"), RED-GREEN-REFACTOR cycle discipline
- **skills/build/SKILL.md** - Requirements gathering approach in Phase 1 (ask one question at a time, YAGNI ruthlessly, 200-300 word design sections with incremental approval)

